# 2. Local Full-Text Search — Mandatory

Implement VitePress local fuzzy full-text search using MiniSearch.

This functionality must be actually operational, not simply represented by a search button.

VitePress supports this natively:

```ts
import { defineConfig } from 'vitepress'

export default defineConfig({
  themeConfig: {
    search: {
      provider: 'local'
    }
  }
})
```

However, our project must support configuring this behavior through the project's JSON configuration system.

